# Build context is app/: only lir-agent and decision-layer sources are needed.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[oc]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/.audit
**/.adk
**/tests
# Secrets never enter the image; Cloud Run injects them from Secret Manager.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
evals
